   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **August 2023 (Saturday)**: mythic rare: 2 archived performances [4]\n- **Comes A Time**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **mmj2023-08-19.vwmuledpa** (recommended): source not stated; 16 songs; 102 min [1]\n- **mmj2023-08-19.dpa4028.flac24**: source not stated; 15 songs; 102 min [2]\n- **mmj2023-08-19.dpa4011.flac24**: source not stated; 15 songs; 102 min [3]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Second of two nights at Greek Theatre, co-billed with Fleet Foxes; MMJ played second [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mmj2023-08-19.vwmuledpa**: taped by Alex Leary; transferred by Alex Leary; source: DPA 4023 > Sound Devices MixPre-6 (24/48) [1]. Also: Recorded with DPA 4023 mics into Sound Devices MixPre-6, transferred via MP6 to iMac [1]\n- **mmj2023-08-19.dpa4028.flac24**: taped by Ryan Hoyt; source: dpa4028 > v2 > 744 [2]\n- **mmj2023-08-19.dpa4011.flac24**: taped by Ryan Hoyt; source: dpa4011er > sx-m2d2 [3]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by The Greek Theatre: [Fleet Foxes & My Morning Jacket Tickets | 19 August 2023 | The Greek Theatre](https://www.thegreektheatreberkeley.com/events/fleet-foxes-my-morning-jacket-2/) [5]",
